        "sourceId": "OWNER-CONFIRMATION-CP5-2026-08-09",
        "sourceType": "OWNER_CONFIRMATION",
        "statement": "Balanced and Explore the Major remain separate searches. Balanced prefers feasible even pacing. Explore is available only in effective freshman and sophomore contexts, is compared at yearIndex 0 with the selected same-context Balanced plan, must be lighter and materially distinct, and softly prefers a nondecreasing backloaded distribution. Two or three final-year tracked requirements are common and four is acceptable; this is nonblocking planning guidance, not Hanover academic policy.",
