        "sourceType": "OWNER_CONFIRMATION",
        "statement": "One Year Early is offered only to students whose effective standing is freshman or sophomore. Junior and senior requests are safely normalized to the standard graduation timeline. This is a nonacademic product and strategy-eligibility decision and does not change plan feasibility or academic policy.",
